{"slug":"beautify-windows-terminal","title":"美化windows11的终端","date":"2021-11-01","tags":["Windows"],"category":"Skills","excerpt":"美化windows11的终端","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>微软开源社区的几大项目都做得非常好，windows-terminal也是其中之一，今天来记录下美化windows terminal的过程</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"windows-terminal\">Windows Terminal</h2>\n<p>Windows11默认安装Windows Terminal，如果是Windows10需要去Store里搜索安装</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装并使用oh-my-posh\">安装并使用Oh My Posh</h2>\n<p><code>Oh My Posh</code>是一个可以让你自定义终端样式的工具，并且包含多种主题样式供选择</p>\n<h3 id=\"安装\">安装</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>以管理员身份运行<code>Windows Terminal</code></li>\n<li>输入<code>get-executionpolicy</code>，如果得到的输出是：<code>restricted</code>，则需要输入：<code>set-executionpolicy remotesigned</code></li>\n<li>安装并导入<code>Oh My Posh</code>主题样式</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Install-Module</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> oh-my-posh</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -Scope</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> CurrentUser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Import-Module</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> oh-my-posh</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>安装并查看所有主题</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Get-PoshThemes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Get-PoshThemes</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -list</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>使用某个主题</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Set-PoshPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -Theme</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> [你想使用的主题名称]</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"设置每次打开终端自动加载主题\">设置每次打开终端自动加载主题</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>查看终端配置文件</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">$PROFILE</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>编辑上面的文件（如果没有则创建），输入以下内容</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Import-Module</span><span style=\"color:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\"> oh-my-posh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#59873A;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">Set-PoshPrompt</span><span style=\"color:#A65E2B;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> -Theme</span><span style=\"color:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> [你想使用的主题名称]</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">sh</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"设置终端亚克力效果背景图片等如果需要的话\">设置终端亚克力效果，背景图片等（如果需要的话）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>打开<code>Windows Terminal</code></li>\n<li>点击设置</li>\n<li>点击左侧Windows PowerShell</li>\n<li>点击外观</li>\n<li>向下滑动就能看到亚克力效果跟背景图片设置项</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"效果\">效果</h2>\n<figure><img src=\"./images/438F10B1-F7E6-404a-AA6D-46D218E017D3.png\" alt=\"效果\"><figcaption>效果</figcaption></figure>\n<h2 id=\"参考\">参考</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://ohmyposh.dev/docs/pwsh\">PowerShell | Oh My Posh</a></li>\n<li>[]</li>\n</ul>","related":[{"slug":"how-to-use-color-note-in-phone-and-windows","title":"在Android和windows中使用ColorNote同步笔记","date":"2020-03-28","tags":["Windows","Android"],"category":"Skills","excerpt":"在Android和windows中使用ColorNote同步笔记","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"how-to-update-andriod-for-pixel2","title":"如何给pixel2升级Android版本，并同时解决Pixel2发热易卡顿，高耗电问题","date":"2020-11-24","tags":["Android","Pixel","Google"],"category":"Skills","excerpt":"今年刚买的OnePlus 7T Pro屏幕摔坏了，维修需要三天，于是把之前用的Pixel2拿出来先顶几天，但是使用Pixel2时遇到了这些问题： 耗电莫名的快 时不时就发热、卡顿 为了解决这个问题我尝试了这几个方法 安装黑阈app 可行，但","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"vue-mixin-usage","title":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","date":"2021-12-23","tags":["Vue"],"category":"Front-end","excerpt":"Vue2中的mixin使用方式小结","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}